ant giant carnivorous insect~
a carnivorous ant~
An enormous insect scavenges the dunes.
~
Resembling the tiny creatures you often tread upon, this six-legged creature
is closer to your own size. Ragged hair covers its chitinous body, and those
nearest its mouth appear to contain pieces of its latest repast - the rancid
smell of rotting flesh wafts around this giant pest. Its powerful mandibles,
contracting slowly, look strong enough to dismember a human leg. You can see
your own distorted reflection in its black, bulbous eyes.
~
